WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.640
The industry sources point toward broader
assisted work, with important limits.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.160
Gartner provides a forecast
of tool adoption.

00:00:08.227 --> 00:00:12.000
McKinsey provides survey evidence about
organizational change and delivery.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.680
DORA examines how AI
interacts with the surrounding

00:00:15.727 --> 00:00:18.960
engineering system. These are
different kinds of evidence.

00:00:19.076 --> 00:00:22.160
Together they support
investment in workflow,

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.160
testing and platform foundations.
They do not prove that installing

00:00:26.187 --> 00:00:29.600
an assistant causes a particular
productivity or quality outcome.
